  "rationale": "37 units of Cream 500ML at Dark store 04 (North Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the online sell-by deadline on 2026-09-23; doing nothing writes off ₹7064 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹11519. This play uses a bundle with SKU-CREAM-BUN-400G at ₹283 for 411 consented customers (Personal care regulars, Tea connoisseurs, Everyday staples shoppers, Sweets occasionals, Premium Tea regulars, Household essentials buyers): expected 37 units, margin ₹869, discount cost ₹1184, waste avoided ₹7064 (CI 2 to 108 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs Cream 500ML with Cream Bun 400G at a bundle price of 283 INR, which satisfies the 8% dairy margin floor and is preferred over markdowns by policy. It targets all consented customers across available segments to maximize reach and clear the 37 units at risk before the online sell-by deadline.",
